+# F-32: Tend UI Task Selection
+
+## Result
+
+Status: `[x] complete`
+
+Card, table and select-all task controls render through Tend UI `Checkbox` while S-Tracker remains the owner of selected IDs and bulk actions.
+
+## Ownership Contract
+
+1. `tasks-view.js` creates stable mount points for both task surfaces and the table header.
+2. `task-selection.jsx` renders controlled Checkbox portals and emits `s-tracker:selection-request`.
+3. `floating-action-bar.js` updates `window.selectedTaskIds` and row state.
+4. Vanilla code publishes the confirmed state through `s-tracker:selection-changed`.
+5. React refreshes checked and indeterminate presentation from the confirmed mount datasets.
+
+The adapter does not read or mutate selected IDs, task data, pagination, filters or bulk-action behavior.
+
+## Public Package Export
+
+```text
+@10d/tend-ui/primitives/Checkbox
+```
+
+The local tarball provides ESM, CommonJS and TypeScript entrypoints.
